WEBVTT

00:00:02.804 --> 00:00:06.875
CANDY CANDY

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:15.248
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:15.805 --> 00:00:21.483
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:25.548
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:28.530
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:28.565 --> 00:00:33.649
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:40.992
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:47.177
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:47.212 --> 00:00:53.325
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.123
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:56.158 --> 00:00:59.349
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:17.126 --> 00:01:22.097
Candy worked hard to become
one of the Leagans.

00:01:22.132 --> 00:01:27.275
But instead, they turned her
into a servant.

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:33.928
On the same day, Candy met
a well dressed boy called Archibald.

00:01:34.797 --> 00:01:39.856
Archie comforted Candy
who lost herself in sadness.

00:01:40.164 --> 00:01:44.762
Invitation of happiness.

00:01:54.912 --> 00:01:56.526
Candy! Candy!

00:01:56.561 --> 00:01:57.925
Yes, what is it?

00:01:58.463 --> 00:02:02.638
Candy, won't you come with me?
I'm going to town to buy a new dress!

00:02:02.841 --> 00:02:04.834
To buy a new dress... wow!

00:02:05.344 --> 00:02:08.947
Eliza, hurry up!
What are you doing there?

00:02:21.384 --> 00:02:22.932
It's so fun!

00:02:23.078 --> 00:02:25.007
That's right. More good things
are about to happen.

00:02:25.488 --> 00:02:26.163
What things?

00:02:26.198 --> 00:02:28.621
Things that have nothing
to do with you.

00:02:47.681 --> 00:02:49.484
You wait here.

00:02:50.305 --> 00:02:52.240
Yup, my thoughts exactly.

00:02:56.285 --> 00:02:57.495
Take this.

00:02:59.657 --> 00:03:00.676
This too.

00:03:14.295 --> 00:03:15.934
Thank you, mr. Steyn!

00:03:16.284 --> 00:03:18.028
C'mon, hold them up a bit.

00:03:18.046 --> 00:03:19.818
Be careful, or you might drop them!

00:03:20.374 --> 00:03:21.910
Is this all we had to buy?

00:03:22.467 --> 00:03:23.739
That's it.

00:03:24.653 --> 00:03:27.029
Candy, can you do something
for me?

00:03:27.064 --> 00:03:31.406
Won't you go and buy two books for me;
"Elegance" and "French doll's dream".

00:03:31.558 --> 00:03:32.938
I can do that.

00:03:32.973 --> 00:03:36.093
No, it's okay.
Candy, you go.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.923
Here's "Elegance", but what's up
with that "French doll"-thing?

00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:45.265
Dream. "French doll's dream."

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.310
Hmmh, I wonder if we have one of those.

00:03:47.891 --> 00:03:49.263
Hold on.

00:03:56.698 --> 00:03:58.624
They really did what they had in mind.

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.817
Oh well, got me this time.

00:04:02.189 --> 00:04:04.100
Can't help it, I'll have to go
back on foot.

00:04:16.752 --> 00:04:19.078
Hey, Archie's friend!

00:04:19.483 --> 00:04:22.528
You're the person who called
Archie from the car?

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:24.378
Going for a walk all alone?

00:04:25.116 --> 00:04:27.971
That's not it.
They left me behind.

00:04:28.347 --> 00:04:29.686
That's horrible.

00:04:30.165 --> 00:04:31.546
I'll give you a lift!

00:04:31.952 --> 00:04:33.119
Thanks!

00:04:33.147 --> 00:04:34.911
Well, get in!

00:04:35.258 --> 00:04:36.184
Thanks.

00:04:38.245 --> 00:04:39.301
Alright, let's go!

00:04:39.572 --> 00:04:41.310
Alistear's special vehicle!

00:04:48.505 --> 00:04:51.284
It's a wonderful car!
And incredibly fast, too!

00:04:51.319 --> 00:04:53.499
Is it? I built it.

00:04:54.706 --> 00:04:56.102
This is a test drive.

00:04:56.517 --> 00:04:57.599
Test drive?

00:04:58.238 --> 00:05:01.246
I plunged into the lake the other day!
I got lucky though.

00:05:07.075 --> 00:05:08.949
Hey, here's the lake!

00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:10.509
Are you afraid?

00:05:12.713 --> 00:05:13.858
You don't have to be!

00:05:13.893 --> 00:05:14.906
I'm not!

00:05:16.735 --> 00:05:20.120
I could let go of the steering wheel.
The steering is so precise!

00:05:23.424 --> 00:05:25.522
Don't let go of that!

00:05:26.319 --> 00:05:28.403
-It's okay!
-I'm not so sure!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:35.910
Well, I know a shortcut from here. It will
get you back faster to Eliza's place.

00:05:35.945 --> 00:05:37.463
You know Eliza?

00:05:37.665 --> 00:05:40.416
Unfortunately, Eliza is a relative of mine.

00:05:41.415 --> 00:05:43.682
Then... you're one of the Adleys?

00:05:44.121 --> 00:05:48.257
Yes. I'm from the Adley family; Archie's
older brother; Alistear Cornwell.

00:05:48.292 --> 00:05:49.054
Nice to meet you.

00:05:49.252 --> 00:05:50.653
Archie's brother?

00:05:51.041 --> 00:05:52.514
It's okay if you call me Stear.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.558
I'm Candy! Candice White!

00:05:57.466 --> 00:05:59.143
That's such a sweet name!

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:04.223
I wonder if he knows anything about the Prince.
He must know something!

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:08.937
But I still don't know his name.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:19.595
The wheel fell off again.
Bummers!

00:06:19.766 --> 00:06:22.240
What are you going to do?

00:06:28.764 --> 00:06:30.801
I'll have to build another one.

00:06:35.731 --> 00:06:39.138
How can you be so carefree
after something like this?

00:06:39.173 --> 00:06:40.914
Nevertheless, this has
spoiled my day a bit.

00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:43.599
By the way, how will you get back?

00:06:44.026 --> 00:06:47.560
It's okay with me. I planned to
go back on foot, anyway.

00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:50.586
That would be a sad
way to come back.

00:06:50.621 --> 00:06:52.384
I told you, I'm okay with this!

00:06:52.814 --> 00:06:54.982
That's right!
Follow me, Candy!

00:06:55.017 --> 00:06:57.222
I'll show you another shortcut.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.766
Shortcut?

00:07:03.564 --> 00:07:05.341
It might be a little
difficult for a girl.

00:07:05.376 --> 00:07:07.327
I'm fine with that!

00:07:07.335 --> 00:07:09.858
Leagan's property is on the
far side of this marsh.

00:07:09.993 --> 00:07:11.363
You cross it through the trees!

00:07:11.766 --> 00:07:13.771
Through the trees?

00:07:18.219 --> 00:07:20.498
What, I'll show you.

00:07:24.307 --> 00:07:27.210
One might get hurt this way!
Now, come along, Candy!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.040
Hey, you can do it!

00:07:35.936 --> 00:07:37.495
Candy, thanks.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.763
I'm used to places like these,
so it's okay.

00:07:40.198 --> 00:07:42.654
Okay, let's head that way.

00:07:42.689 --> 00:07:43.763
I'm going!

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.519
It's the hill behind Leagan's estate!

00:08:18.686 --> 00:08:19.939
Hey!

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:22.127
I almost forgot about you!

00:08:25.176 --> 00:08:26.875
You're almost there!

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:29.407
I'm not cut out for this.

00:08:34.406 --> 00:08:36.250
Stear, are you okay?

00:08:36.285 --> 00:08:39.114
Yeah. I couldn't follow you at all.

00:08:39.737 --> 00:08:41.795
I can go alone from here!

00:08:43.266 --> 00:08:44.450
Thank you, Stear.

00:08:44.485 --> 00:08:46.382
Nah, it's nothing. See you again.

00:08:46.968 --> 00:08:47.726
Okay.

00:08:48.751 --> 00:08:50.882
-See you then.
-Farewell!

00:08:56.712 --> 00:08:59.675
Candy!

00:09:00.522 --> 00:09:02.162
What's the matter, Stear?

00:09:02.839 --> 00:09:06.333
Now I know the reason Archie
called you "miss tomboy"!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.557
Oh no. I forgot to ask him about the Prince.

00:09:18.004 --> 00:09:19.043
Stear!

00:09:22.674 --> 00:09:25.999
Okay. I'll ask you the
next time we meet!

00:09:45.836 --> 00:09:47.784
Kurin! I'm back.

00:09:47.819 --> 00:09:50.201
Thanks for waiting me here!

00:09:58.062 --> 00:10:01.319
Brother! Brother!

00:10:01.354 --> 00:10:02.189
What's the matter, Eliza?

00:10:02.224 --> 00:10:03.483
Candy is back!

00:10:04.302 --> 00:10:06.001
What? Already?

00:10:10.887 --> 00:10:14.459
I thought that she would have come back
late at night, if she went on foot!

00:10:15.968 --> 00:10:17.555
I'm sure those two are surprised.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:23.895
Kurin, I was swimming in the lake!
I'm so good at crawl swim!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:28.160
-No way.
-That's a lie! She's so rude!

00:10:30.759 --> 00:10:34.123
Did you hear? Mistress and Master
say that there'll be trouble!

00:10:34.158 --> 00:10:38.411
Mary, who will be arriving then?

00:10:38.446 --> 00:10:41.653
The head of the Adley family will
be moving into this place!

00:10:42.101 --> 00:10:44.122
The head of the Adley family?

00:10:44.157 --> 00:10:47.104
That's grand aunt Elroy, right?

00:10:47.139 --> 00:10:49.245
I heard that she's a really
scary person!

00:10:49.654 --> 00:10:52.621
That's why entire family
is throwing a big party.

00:10:53.703 --> 00:10:56.164
...and that's why Eliza
was buying that dress.

00:10:59.541 --> 00:11:01.278
Big party...?

00:11:09.589 --> 00:11:11.807
This has nothing to do with you!

00:11:15.124 --> 00:11:18.318
That's right. It really has
nothing to do with me.

00:11:24.154 --> 00:11:34.501
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Telecined episodes with scratchy audio and dropped
frames are almost all gone now. Hang in there.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.075
Doesn't this dress look good on me?

00:11:50.759 --> 00:11:51.862
Candy?

00:11:52.114 --> 00:11:53.291
Yes, come in!

00:11:54.849 --> 00:11:56.411
Why are you sneezing?

00:11:56.412 --> 00:11:57.615
It's nothing.

00:11:58.102 --> 00:11:59.944
Hey, aren't you wet?

00:11:59.979 --> 00:12:00.821
A bit.

00:12:01.078 --> 00:12:02.343
I was in the lake.

00:12:02.378 --> 00:12:04.118
They pulled a prank on you, again?

00:12:04.587 --> 00:12:06.231
Don't worry!

00:12:06.266 --> 00:12:08.249
You were out on a walk?

00:12:08.284 --> 00:12:11.351
Yeah! I was trying to find
my Prince!

00:12:13.809 --> 00:12:16.776
But I found two of them!

00:12:17.628 --> 00:12:21.713
Two princes? It almost
sounds like a fairy tale.

00:12:23.836 --> 00:12:26.038
Maybe it really does
sound like a fairy tale!

00:12:26.073 --> 00:12:27.567
Candy, you!

00:12:28.535 --> 00:12:30.804
By the way, was there something else?

00:12:30.839 --> 00:12:33.584
Oh, I forgot!
Miss Eliza wants to see you!

00:12:34.014 --> 00:12:35.057
I see.

00:12:36.304 --> 00:12:37.638
Candy?

00:12:39.163 --> 00:12:40.522
What's the matter, Dorothy?

00:12:43.285 --> 00:12:44.960
Don't give in to them.

00:12:46.799 --> 00:12:49.569
Don't worry, Dorothy!
Thanks.

00:12:52.029 --> 00:12:53.102
It's Candy!

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:54.988
Enter!

00:12:57.513 --> 00:12:59.861
Candy, what do you think?
Does it look good on me?

00:13:00.458 --> 00:13:02.030
Wow, it's beautiful!

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:06.081
Don't touch it!

00:13:07.046 --> 00:13:08.573
You'll get it dirty.

00:13:09.198 --> 00:13:10.098
Eliza!

00:13:10.929 --> 00:13:11.874
Yes?

00:13:11.909 --> 00:13:13.076
Let me see!

00:13:13.111 --> 00:13:13.775
Yes!

00:13:18.317 --> 00:13:22.765
This time, Mother will wear
her swan-style hat. It's pretty.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:23.616
Eliza?

00:13:23.887 --> 00:13:25.341
Yes! Coming!

00:13:51.147 --> 00:13:52.434
It really is pretty.

00:14:45.594 --> 00:14:47.254
What are you doing?

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:56.053
That's not the kind of dress to
be seen on someone from Pony's home!

00:14:59.465 --> 00:15:00.755
Now, get out.

00:15:01.765 --> 00:15:03.633
Quickly, get out!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:27.484
But it would have looked so good on me...

00:15:33.562 --> 00:15:34.371
What?

00:15:35.672 --> 00:15:39.582
These were sent in by the Adley family.

00:15:47.277 --> 00:15:48.745
This is...

00:15:49.161 --> 00:15:50.379
What?

00:15:50.798 --> 00:15:53.008
An invitation to the party!

00:15:53.211 --> 00:15:56.845
But we already received all
the invitations.

00:15:57.065 --> 00:15:58.925
This one is for Candy.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:03.851
"We invite miss Candice White
to the Adley family party."

00:16:03.852 --> 00:16:06.079
"Please kindly escort her to the party."

00:16:06.114 --> 00:16:07.796
"Alistear Cornwell."

00:16:08.357 --> 00:16:10.990
What, Stear inviting Candy...?

00:16:11.781 --> 00:16:14.013
How come he knows her?

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:17.322
There's an another invitation, exactly
like this one, but it's from Archie.

00:16:17.323 --> 00:16:18.847
What, even from Archie?

00:16:18.848 --> 00:16:20.281
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:20.928 --> 00:16:22.786
Anyway, call Candy.

00:16:22.977 --> 00:16:23.640
Yes.

00:16:28.626 --> 00:16:30.219
Enter!

00:16:31.629 --> 00:16:33.663
Candy. Now, come here.

00:16:38.125 --> 00:16:41.099
Candy. You know Stear and Archie?

00:16:41.134 --> 00:16:41.906
Yes.

00:16:43.839 --> 00:16:45.990
Where did you meet them, Candy?

00:16:46.025 --> 00:16:49.092
Where did I...
I met both of them by chance!

00:16:49.211 --> 00:16:50.708
But one at a time!

00:16:51.381 --> 00:16:54.243
By chance, you say?
No way.

00:16:54.278 --> 00:16:57.210
You got invitations from
both of them.

00:16:57.559 --> 00:17:01.740
What? Invitations from Stear
and Archie? Wonderful!

00:17:02.359 --> 00:17:04.266
Here they are.

00:17:08.371 --> 00:17:11.344
Stear and Archie have invited me!

00:17:13.409 --> 00:17:14.596
I don't approve of that!

00:17:16.721 --> 00:17:19.653
If you bring Candy with youself,
I will not be going!

00:17:19.932 --> 00:17:24.894
These invitations are official, so
there's no way I can't take her.

00:17:25.394 --> 00:17:28.427
It's okay to take her, but is that
the kind of dress to wear to the party?

00:17:28.462 --> 00:17:31.955
That's right! She can't go in that dress!

00:17:33.202 --> 00:17:36.988
That's right! She could
borrow one of your dresses.

00:17:37.177 --> 00:17:38.758
What, one of mine...?

00:17:38.793 --> 00:17:41.319
Eliza, borrow her something.

00:17:41.593 --> 00:17:45.854
If I let her go dressed like a hillbilly,
she'll make all the Leagans look bad.

00:17:48.006 --> 00:17:48.990
I won't!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.484
I understand.

00:17:55.497 --> 00:17:57.167
Thank you, Eliza!

00:18:04.945 --> 00:18:06.139
Take this.

00:18:06.174 --> 00:18:07.372
Wow, it's pretty!

00:18:07.407 --> 00:18:09.491
I'll go out, let us
see you when you're done.

00:18:09.731 --> 00:18:10.491
Okay.

00:18:16.841 --> 00:18:21.343
What's going on, Eliza?
What's on your mind?

00:18:28.525 --> 00:18:31.131
I had it made three years ago.

00:18:34.131 --> 00:18:35.842
It's a bit tight.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:43.143
Well, Candy?
Hey, you're much fatter than I am!

00:18:43.178 --> 00:18:45.181
You won't be able to go
to the party like that!

00:18:45.872 --> 00:18:47.420
Give up already!

00:19:06.347 --> 00:19:08.981
What are you doing?!
Give it back!

00:19:09.016 --> 00:19:11.025
My favorite dress!

00:19:11.287 --> 00:19:12.737
Why did you do that?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.624
I'm sorry.

00:19:16.499 --> 00:19:18.367
You can't fix this
by apologizing!

00:19:22.551 --> 00:19:24.330
What's with her?

00:19:29.263 --> 00:19:31.040
-Candy!
-What happened?

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.891
Why have Stear and Archie
invited me in the first place?

00:19:41.701 --> 00:19:43.431
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:20:04.281 --> 00:20:05.498
Candy?

00:20:06.839 --> 00:20:08.584
What happened, Candy?

00:20:10.769 --> 00:20:11.956
It doesn't suit you!

00:20:11.957 --> 00:20:13.131
Well?

00:20:14.988 --> 00:20:19.628
Dress doesn't matter. Go to that
party. The dress doesn't matter at all!

00:20:19.663 --> 00:20:21.590
Candy, believe in yourself.

00:20:26.413 --> 00:20:28.068
Wipe your tears then!

00:20:28.724 --> 00:20:30.629
You're a wonderful girl.

00:20:32.054 --> 00:20:35.295
And that's why Stear and Archie
invited you.

00:20:35.578 --> 00:20:37.673
Even this dress will look
wonderful on you.

00:20:37.674 --> 00:20:39.000
Put this on and go.

00:20:43.368 --> 00:20:45.935
And smile!

00:20:47.433 --> 00:20:50.347
Dorothy...

00:20:50.639 --> 00:20:53.024
You're smiling, Candy.

00:20:55.285 --> 00:20:57.399
That's right, you're pretty!

00:20:57.434 --> 00:21:00.687
And that smile suits you best!

00:21:01.182 --> 00:21:04.641
Miss freckle...?
That smile looks good on you.

00:21:08.425 --> 00:21:11.646
Your friends will wait for
you there, I'm sure.

00:21:12.802 --> 00:21:15.777
-Candy!
-Welcome, Candy!

00:21:16.494 --> 00:21:19.424
Dorothy, I'll go!
Even like this!

00:21:19.966 --> 00:21:21.018
That's the spirit!

00:21:22.096 --> 00:21:25.425
Thank you, Dorothy!
I won't cry anymore.

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:27.236
That's more like it!

00:21:31.932 --> 00:21:35.322
They both saw a falling star.
It was the star of unity.

00:21:36.057 --> 00:21:41.575
Candy's spirit lightened up,
almost as if it wanted to dance.

00:21:42.536 --> 00:21:46.327
To be continued...

00:21:52.079 --> 00:22:00.361
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:22:00.396 --> 00:22:09.587
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:09.994 --> 00:22:18.521
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:22:18.556 --> 00:22:27.841
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:22:27.876 --> 00:22:36.098
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:22:36.133 --> 00:22:47.106
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:22:47.141 --> 00:22:56.720
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.
